flowchart TD
    S[Pipeline result] --> C1{Predicted type in HIGH_STAKES?}
    C1 -->|yes| E1[ESCALATE: high_stakes]
    C1 -->|no| C2{Predicted type in TIME_SENSITIVE?}
    C2 -->|yes| E2[ESCALATE: time_sensitive]
    C2 -->|no| C3{Intent confidence < 0.70?}
    C3 -->|yes| E3[ESCALATE: low_intent]
    C3 -->|no| C4{Dense similarity < 0.55?}
    C4 -->|yes| E4[ESCALATE: low_retrieval]
    C4 -->|no| C5{Retrieved topic != query type?}
    C5 -->|yes| E5[ESCALATE: topic_mismatch]
    C5 -->|no| C6{Retrieved answer is a call-log note?}
    C6 -->|yes| E6[ESCALATE: uninformative_answer]
    C6 -->|no| C7{Answer has dosage or chemical text?}
    C7 -->|yes| E7[ESCALATE: risky_answer]
    C7 -->|no| A[AUTO_ANSWER<br/>return retrieved text + confidence + similarity]
